    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594">

                <pb facs="0887" n="781" sameAs="frus:frus1933-39/pg781"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.20/489: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-09-16T01:00:00+03:00">September 16,
                            1939—1 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 1:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>547. Large troop movements to the Leningrad area are said to have taken place
                    during the past 2 days. For 10 hours last night tanks <pb facs="0888" n="782"
                        xml:id="pg782"/> and heavy artillery passing a given point on the outskirts
                    of Moscow were reported as moving northwest and west.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
